ُوفٞ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"g":["Or","that He may seize them","with","a gradual wasting","But indeed","your Lord","surely Full of Kindness","Most Merciful"],"en":"Or that He would not seize them gradually [in a state of dread]? But indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful.","hit":[5]},{"s":21,"a":92,"w":["إِنَّ","هَٰذِهِۦٓ","أُمَّتُكُمۡ","أُمَّةٗ","وَٰحِدَةٗ","وَأَنَا۠","رَبُّكُمۡ","فَٱعۡبُدُونِ"],"g":["Indeed","this","your religion","religion","one","and I Am","your Lord","so worship Me"],"en":"Indeed this, your religion, is one religion, and I am your Lord, so worship Me.","hit":[6]}],"93":[{"s":41,"a":19,"w":["وَيَوۡمَ","يُحۡشَرُ","أَعۡدَآءُ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَى","ٱلنَّارِ","فَهُمۡ","يُوزَعُونَ"],"g":["And (the) Day","will be gathered","enemies","Allah","to","the Fire","then they","will be assembled in rows"],"en":"And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day when the enemies of Allah will be gathered to the Fire while they are [driven] assembled in rows,","hit":[5]},{"s":11,"a":98,"w":["يَقۡدُمُ","قَوۡمَهُۥ","يَوۡمَ","ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ","فَأَوۡرَدَهُمُ","ٱلنَّارَۖ","وَبِئۡسَ","ٱلۡوِرۡدُ","ٱلۡمَوۡرُودُ"],"g":["He will precede","his people","Day","the Resurrection","and lead them","the Fire","And wretched","the place","to which (they are) led"],"en":"He will precede his people on the Day of Resurrection and lead them into the Fire; and wretched is the place to which they are led.","hit":[5]},{"s":28,"a":41,"w":["وَجَعَلۡنَٰهُمۡ","أَئِمَّةٗ","يَدۡعُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلنَّارِۖ","وَيَوۡمَ","ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ","لَا","يُنصَرُونَ"],"g":["And We made them","leaders","inviting","to","the Fire","and (on the) Day","the Resurrection","not","they will be helped"],"en":"And We made them leaders inviting to the Fire, and on the Day of Resurrection they will not be helped.","hit":[4]}],"94":[{"s":27,"a":13,"w":["فَلَمَّا","جَآءَتۡهُمۡ","ءَايَٰتُنَا","مُبۡصِرَةٗ","قَالُواْ","هَٰذَا","سِحۡرٞ","مُّبِينٞ"],"g":["But when","came to them","Our Signs","visible","they said","This","a magic","manifest"],"en":"But when ther